{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lens of Fear</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic, hyper-immersive, intense action-adventure horror game. Developed by <strong>PlayableGraph</strong> as their debut title. This game combines a portable camera perspective with highly detailed environments and immersive sound design to deliver an authentic horror experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881530/extras/a0a232eb0d1fe162b9f6d9356e1f9cca.webp?t=1774446840\" width=612 height=2 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881530/extras/542f0be170db88ba6e89d71099ba71c0.poster.avif?t=1774446840\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881530/extras/542f0be170db88ba6e89d71099ba71c0.webm?t=1774446840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881530/extras/542f0be170db88ba6e89d71099ba71c0.mp4?t=1774446840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat designed to make you feel you really there, every shot delivers impactful feedback which pulls you into this nightmare</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Aiming</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881530/extras/a0a232eb0d1fe162b9f6d9356e1f9cca.webp?t=1774446840\" width=612 height=2 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881530/extras/eee4636e0c81bcd85ecb86e2b6501cce.poster.avif?t=1774446840\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881530/extras/eee4636e0c81bcd85ecb86e2b6501cce.webm?t=1774446840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881530/extras/eee4636e0c81bcd85ecb86e2b6501cce.mp4?t=1774446840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your arms and weapon move naturally  swaying and tilting like a real person. This motion deepens immersion.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Weather Effects</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881530/extras/a0a232eb0d1fe162b9f6d9356e1f9cca.webp?t=1774446840\" width=612 height=2 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881530/extras/2a5b8da425d07b7fb2f8695b9d1b8825.poster.avif?t=1774446840\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881530/extras/2a5b8da425d07b7fb2f8695b9d1b8825.webm?t=1774446840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881530/extras/2a5b8da425d07b7fb2f8695b9d1b8825.mp4?t=1774446840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic weather effects improves the experience even more.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881530/extras/a0a232eb0d1fe162b9f6d9356e1f9cca.webp?t=1774446840\" width=612 height=2 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a member of a special task force that investigates paranormal activies. Your mission begins with a case of a missing child, leading you to explore abandoned and unsettling locations. As the mystery unfolds, you will face a cult of mutated, human-minded fanatics. You will need to stay sharp, overcome your fear, and survive whatever lurks in the darkness.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881530/extras/a0a232eb0d1fe162b9f6d9356e1f9cca.webp?t=1774446840\" width=612 height=2 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic and immersive body cam perspective</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Authentic ADS (aim down sights) and unique hand movements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-fidelity sound design that makes every moment feel real</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense survival horror atmosphere with terrifying scenes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lens of Fear</strong> challenges you to survive a nightmare. Armed only with your training and your weapon, you must navigate through horrifying environments, respond to split-second threats, and uncover the truth behind the terror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the raw tension of true first-person perspective. Every breath, every footstep and every gunshot makes it feel like you are really there.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3881530?t=1774446840","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3881530?t=1774446840","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881530/e03f91386de9637f2d3a0225e7237c642063b8f2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774446840","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881530/e03f91386de9637f2d3a0225e7237c642063b8f2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774446840","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3910420,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lens of Fear</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic, hyper-immersive, intense action-adventure horror game. Developed by <strong>PlayableGraph</strong> as their debut title. This game combines a portable camera perspective with highly detailed environments and immersive sound design to deliver an authentic horror experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881530/extras/a0a232eb0d1fe162b9f6d9356e1f9cca.webp?t=1774446840\" width=612 height=2 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881530/extras/542f0be170db88ba6e89d71099ba71c0.poster.avif?t=1774446840\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881530/extras/542f0be170db88ba6e89d71099ba71c0.webm?t=1774446840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881530/extras/542f0be170db88ba6e89d71099ba71c0.mp4?t=1774446840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat designed to make you feel you really there, every shot delivers impactful feedback which pulls you into this nightmare</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Aiming</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881530/extras/a0a232eb0d1fe162b9f6d9356e1f9cca.webp?t=1774446840\" width=612 height=2 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881530/extras/eee4636e0c81bcd85ecb86e2b6501cce.poster.avif?t=1774446840\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881530/extras/eee4636e0c81bcd85ecb86e2b6501cce.webm?t=1774446840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881530/extras/eee4636e0c81bcd85ecb86e2b6501cce.mp4?t=1774446840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your arms and weapon move naturally  swaying and tilting like a real person. This motion deepens immersion.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Weather Effects</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881530/extras/a0a232eb0d1fe162b9f6d9356e1f9cca.webp?t=1774446840\" width=612 height=2 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881530/extras/2a5b8da425d07b7fb2f8695b9d1b8825.poster.avif?t=1774446840\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881530/extras/2a5b8da425d07b7fb2f8695b9d1b8825.webm?t=1774446840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881530/extras/2a5b8da425d07b7fb2f8695b9d1b8825.mp4?t=1774446840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic weather effects improves the experience even more.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881530/extras/a0a232eb0d1fe162b9f6d9356e1f9cca.webp?t=1774446840\" width=612 height=2 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a member of a special task force that investigates paranormal activies. Your mission begins with a case of a missing child, leading you to explore abandoned and unsettling locations. As the mystery unfolds, you will face a cult of mutated, human-minded fanatics. You will need to stay sharp, overcome your fear, and survive whatever lurks in the darkness.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881530/extras/a0a232eb0d1fe162b9f6d9356e1f9cca.webp?t=1774446840\" width=612 height=2 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic and immersive body cam perspective</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Authentic ADS (aim down sights) and unique hand movements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-fidelity sound design that makes every moment feel real</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense survival horror atmosphere with terrifying scenes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lens of Fear</strong> challenges you to survive a nightmare. Armed only with your training and your weapon, you must navigate through horrifying environments, respond to split-second threats, and uncover the truth behind the terror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the raw tension of true first-person perspective. Every breath, every footstep and every gunshot makes it feel like you are really there.</p>","developers":["PlayableGraph"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881530/7760f888bb6ab342e55e0c22a1db28abf3d7e2c7/header.jpg?t=1774446840","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3881530/513118325/a04c45552777d637a8dd619a0fa642bfdfa517d8/1755123373/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755181700","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3881530/513118325/a04c45552777d637a8dd619a0fa642bfdfa517d8/1755123373/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755181700","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3881530/513118325/a04c45552777d637a8dd619a0fa642bfdfa517d8/1755123373/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1755181700","id":257182871,"name":"Lens Of Fear - Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257182871/c59e668f59fefbadf90e8e528d99feccdf0d4a29/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755181700"}],"name":"Lens Of Fear","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10, Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i3 7th, AMD Ryzen 1xxx series<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1